    "description": "•\tArchitected and developed  tools for Automated Simulation review and visualization.  This reduced  the amount of hours the team spent in verifying regression testing.\n•\tImproved process for automation and reliability of simulation input flow.\n•\tCoordinated and organized the test operations for Flight Software Quality testing of Avionics suite using a hardware-in-the-loop embedded Flight Software simulation environment. Developed dispersion inputs for test campaigns.\n•\tInput Process and software configuration management. Software documentation using tools like  DOXYGEN & POD for inline automatic documentation generation.\n•\tSimulation coding development using agile team methods.  This simulation upgraded trajectory analysis and consolidated two heritage product lines, Atlas & Delta rockets.  It included Flight software emulation modeling and many options for trajectory analysis including Monte Carlo and optimization analyses.\n•\tAutomated the vehicle mass properties database process utilizing the trajectory simulation as the single source for providing mass property data to several tools.  This reduced the amount manual manipulation required to process this data and provided more reliability. \n",
